### Medical Software Disclaimer

MediKiosk is an **AI-assisted patient intake and clinical-support prototype**.
It is not intended to provide medical diagnosis, treatment, prescription,
or emergency medical decision-making.

AI-generated questions, summaries, classifications, and other outputs must
be reviewed and verified by a qualified healthcare professional before being
used for clinical decision-making.

Patients should not use MediKiosk as a substitute for professional medical
advice, diagnosis, or treatment.

